# 🔐 Personal Password Manager

A simple command-line based Password Manager built using Python.  
This project allows users to save passwords, view saved passwords, and generate random passwords.

## 🚀 Features

- 💾 Save website passwords
- 👀 View saved passwords
- 🔑 Generate random passwords
- 📁 Store passwords using a text file
- 🗂️ Use Python dictionaries for password management
- ⚠️ Handle missing password files using exception handling
- 🔄 Interactive menu-driven program

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- Dictionary
- File Handling
- Functions
- Loops & Conditional Statements
- Exception Handling
- `random` module
- `string` module

